 one-class embedding","author":"Deng","year":"2022"},{"key":"10.1016\/j.patcog.2024.111215_b28","series-title":"CVPR","first-page":"3914","article-title":"Destseg: Segmentation guided denoising student-teacher for anomaly detection","author":"Zhang","year":"2023"},{"key":"10.1016\/j.patcog.2024.111215_b29","series-title":"Fastflow: Unsupervised anomaly detection and localization via 2d normalizing flows","author":"Yu","year":"2021"},{"key":"10.1016\/j.patcog.2024.111215_b30","series-title":"WACV","first-page":"98","article-title":"Cflow-ad: Real-time unsupervised anomaly detection with localization via conditional normalizing flows","author":"Gudovskiy","year":"2022"},{"key":"10.1016\/j.patcog.2024.111215_b31","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","DOI":"10.1016\/j.comnet.2021.108472","article-title":"Matec: A lightweight neural network for online encrypted traffic classification","volume":"199","author":"Cheng","year":"2021","journal-title":"Comput. Netw."},{"issue":"3","key":"10.1016\/j.patcog.2024.111215_b32","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","first-page":"1999","DOI":"10.1007\/s00500-019-04030-2","article-title":"Deep packet: A novel approach for encrypted traffic classification using deep learning","volume":"24","author":"Lotfollahi","year":"2020","journal-title":"Soft Comput."},{"key":"10.1016\/j.patcog.2024.111215_b33","series-title":"ICANN","first-page":"615","article-title":"Learning traffic as videos: A spatio-temporal VAE approach for traffic data imputation","author":"Chen","year":"2021"},{"key":"10.1016\/j.patcog.2024.111215_b34","series-title":"ECCV","first-page":"3","article-title":"Cbam: Convolutional block attention module","author":"Woo","year":"2018"},{"key":"10.1016\/j.patcog.2024.111215_b35","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","DOI":"10.1016\/j.patcog.2023.109795","article-title":"Hyperspectral anomaly detection based on variational background inference and generative adversarial network","volume":"143","author":"Wang","year":"2023","journal-title":"Pattern Recognit